        <div class="flex flex-col">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
            <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-blue-100 text-blue-600 flex items-center justify-center">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M4 6a2 2 0 012-2h2a2 2 0 012 2v2a2 2 0 01-2 2H6a2 2 0 01-2-2V6zM14 6a2 2 0 012-2h2a2 2 0 012 2v2a2 2 0 01-2 2h-2a2 2 0 01-2-2V6zM4 16a2 2 0 012-2h2a2 2 0 012 2v2a2 2 0 01-2 2H6a2 2 0 01-2-2v-2zM14 16a2 2 0 012-2h2a2 2 0 012 2v2a2 2 0 01-2 2h-2a2 2 0 01-2-2v-2z"></path></svg>
            </div>
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">全站核心频道导览</h2>
          </div>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 mt-2 sm:ml-11">快速定位最新榜单、测评数据与网络排障工具箱</div>
      </div>
      
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
        <!-- Card 1: 机场推荐 -->
        <div class="bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 rounded-3xl p-6 md:p-8 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-all flex flex-col group">
           <div class="flex justify-between items-start mb-6">
             <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-blue-50 dark:bg-blue-900/30 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center text-2xl">🏆</div>
             <span class="px-3 py-1 bg-blue-50 text-blue-600 dark:bg-blue-900/30 dark:text-blue-400 text-xs font-bold rounded-full">精选榜单</span>
           </div>
           <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mb-3">机场推荐汇总</h3>
           <p class="text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 text-sm mb-8 leading-relaxed flex-grow">剔除跑路风险，筛选出最具性价比与稳定性的宝藏机场，流媒体全解锁。</p>
           <a href="/reviews/" class="text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400 font-bold text-sm inline-flex items-center group-hover:underline mt-auto">查看机场推荐 &rarr;</a>
        </div>
        
        <!-- Card 2: 机场测评 -->
        <div class="bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 rounded-3xl p-6 md:p-8 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-all flex flex-col group">
           <div class="flex justify-between items-start mb-6">
             <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-amber-50 dark:bg-amber-900/30 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center text-2xl">✈️</div>
             <span class="px-3 py-1 bg-amber-50 text-amber-600 dark:bg-amber-900/30 dark:text-amber-400 text-xs font-bold rounded-full">首轮实测</span>
           </div>
           <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mb-3">机场测评汇总</h3>
           <p class="text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 text-sm mb-8 leading-relaxed flex-grow">晚高峰、解锁、客户端兼容、售后与备用方案，单线程极限测速全公开。</p>
           <a href="/evaluations/" class="text-amber-600 dark:text-amber-400 font-bold text-sm inline-flex items-center group-hover:underline mt-auto">查看机场测评 &rarr;</a>
        </div>

        <!-- Card 3: 网络工具 -->
        <div class="bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 rounded-3xl p-6 md:p-8 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-all flex flex-col group">
           <div class="flex justify-between items-start mb-6">
             <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-emerald-50 dark:bg-emerald-900/30 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center text-2xl">🧰</div>
             <span class="px-3 py-1 bg-emerald-50 text-emerald-600 dark:bg-emerald-900/30 dark:text-emerald-400 text-xs font-bold rounded-full">自动化测试</span>
           </div>
                <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mb-3">网络工具汇总</h3>
           <p class="text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 text-sm mb-8 leading-relaxed flex-grow">节点连通性、IP纯净度、DNS防泄露检测，排障体检必备外部工具集。</p>
           <a href="/tools/" class="text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400 font-bold text-sm inline-flex items-center group-hover:underline mt-auto">查看网络工具 &rarr;</a>
        </div>
