      <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-8 border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 pb-4">
        <div class="flex flex-col">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
            <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-primary-100 text-primary-600 flex items-center justify-center">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 20H5a2 2 0 01-2-2V6a2 2 0 012-2h10a2 2 0 012 2v1m2 13a2 2 0 01-2-2V7m2 13a2 2 0 002-2V9a2 2 0 00-2-2h-2m-4-3H9M7 16h6M7 8h6v4H7V8z"></path></svg>
            </div>
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">精选知识指南</h2>
          </div>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 mt-2 sm:ml-11">精选涵盖基础使用、进阶配置与防坑避雷的全面知识指南</p>
        </div>
        <a href="/guides/" class="text-primary-600 font-bold hover:text-primary-700 hover:underline text-sm">查看全部指南 &rarr;</a>
